{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2694\ufe0f<strong>BECOME A LEGEND OF THE ARENA</strong>\u2694\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a deadly tournament where every run is different and every fight pushes your skills to the limit. <br>Defeat enemies, survive random events, hype up the crowd, and climb your way to victory through skill, upgrades, and pure chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f<strong>Choose Your Combat Style</strong>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between using a sword and shield, dual wielding, or using beefy two-handed weapons. Each style has it's own benefits and drawbacks. Block, dodge, parry, and tank hits the way you see fit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/cce740dbbe319e6b0b23df894deaa3b0.poster.avif?t=1767734306\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/cce740dbbe319e6b0b23df894deaa3b0.webm?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/cce740dbbe319e6b0b23df894deaa3b0.mp4?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2728<strong>Level Up Your Skills and Unlock Powerful Special Abilities</strong>\u2728</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn skill points that you can spend on 6 different skill types. Choose a main class and unlock a special ability that will make each class build unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/eedaa81491096765123f5072870570d3.poster.avif?t=1767734306\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/eedaa81491096765123f5072870570d3.webm?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/eedaa81491096765123f5072870570d3.mp4?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfad<strong>Entertain the Crowd</strong>\ud83c\udfad</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get paid out after each fight based on how well you entertained the crowd. Use your gold to buy weapons, shields, and armor. The crowd likes when you put on a show, so attack, parry, and emote on your enemies to gain popularity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/c58549602f26234c86fd030f12172d76.poster.avif?t=1767734306\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/c58549602f26234c86fd030f12172d76.webm?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/c58549602f26234c86fd030f12172d76.mp4?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd2e<strong>Enchant Your Gear</strong>\ud83d\udd2e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain soul points through fights and use them to enchant your weapons. Watch out though: not all enchantments are good! You can choose to play it safe or hope your gamble pays off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/c6e048c34e607e349c7aca87f93015b4.poster.avif?t=1767734306\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/c6e048c34e607e349c7aca87f93015b4.webm?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/c6e048c34e607e349c7aca87f93015b4.mp4?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<strong>Perfect Your Build With Equipment</strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open lootbags and get equipment from 5 different rarities. Use them to create unique builds that highlight your class's strengths or cover it's weaknesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/8ef28fb3eb5381b2f5d443caf06f2426.poster.avif?t=1767734306\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/8ef28fb3eb5381b2f5d443caf06f2426.webm?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/8ef28fb3eb5381b2f5d443caf06f2426.mp4?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc80<strong>Face Challenging Bosses</strong>\ud83d\udc80</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb your way up the leaderboard of champions, defeating each of the top ranked arena fighters on your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/4a3ad5538c9a956d5271d3e147a88211.poster.avif?t=1767734306\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/4a3ad5538c9a956d5271d3e147a88211.webm?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/4a3ad5538c9a956d5271d3e147a88211.mp4?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfb2<strong>Random Arenas And Events</strong>\ud83c\udfb2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entertain the crowd in different arenas with random events, making each fight come with it's own unique challenges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udd1d<strong>Interact With The Town</strong>\ud83e\udd1d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the people of the town and help them out to get bonuses that will help you on your way to the top!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls-lite fighting - Dodge, block, parry, and strike using responsive action combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op multiplayer - Become champions together with up to 16 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Class System - Buy starting classes with in game currency you get from defeating bosses, or unlock your class as you go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment - Customize your build with over 50 pieces of equipment from 5 different rarities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty adjustments - from easy to gladiator mode, choose what fits your skill level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your luck - Gamble for the most powerful enchantments and face beneficial or harmful events each fight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overpowered emotes - Use emotes strategically to gain favor with the crowd</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face new challenges - Each run will have new challenges randomly chosen based on the difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave - Stop whenever and pick back up where you left off</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3974390?t=1767734306","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/1073c7e4d0167057cb74ee103cb924da5a5641c0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767734306","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/37949a1c707f9863952e0e2aa04234024fb3018e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767734306","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/37949a1c707f9863952e0e2aa04234024fb3018e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767734306","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4092060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2694\ufe0f<strong>BECOME A LEGEND OF THE ARENA</strong>\u2694\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a deadly tournament where every run is different and every fight pushes your skills to the limit. <br>Defeat enemies, survive random events, hype up the crowd, and climb your way to victory through skill, upgrades, and pure chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f<strong>Choose Your Combat Style</strong>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between using a sword and shield, dual wielding, or using beefy two-handed weapons. Each style has it's own benefits and drawbacks. Block, dodge, parry, and tank hits the way you see fit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/cce740dbbe319e6b0b23df894deaa3b0.poster.avif?t=1767734306\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/cce740dbbe319e6b0b23df894deaa3b0.webm?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/cce740dbbe319e6b0b23df894deaa3b0.mp4?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2728<strong>Level Up Your Skills and Unlock Powerful Special Abilities</strong>\u2728</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn skill points that you can spend on 6 different skill types. Choose a main class and unlock a special ability that will make each class build unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/eedaa81491096765123f5072870570d3.poster.avif?t=1767734306\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/eedaa81491096765123f5072870570d3.webm?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/eedaa81491096765123f5072870570d3.mp4?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfad<strong>Entertain the Crowd</strong>\ud83c\udfad</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get paid out after each fight based on how well you entertained the crowd. Use your gold to buy weapons, shields, and armor. The crowd likes when you put on a show, so attack, parry, and emote on your enemies to gain popularity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/c58549602f26234c86fd030f12172d76.poster.avif?t=1767734306\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/c58549602f26234c86fd030f12172d76.webm?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/c58549602f26234c86fd030f12172d76.mp4?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd2e<strong>Enchant Your Gear</strong>\ud83d\udd2e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain soul points through fights and use them to enchant your weapons. Watch out though: not all enchantments are good! You can choose to play it safe or hope your gamble pays off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/c6e048c34e607e349c7aca87f93015b4.poster.avif?t=1767734306\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/c6e048c34e607e349c7aca87f93015b4.webm?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/c6e048c34e607e349c7aca87f93015b4.mp4?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<strong>Perfect Your Build With Equipment</strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open lootbags and get equipment from 5 different rarities. Use them to create unique builds that highlight your class's strengths or cover it's weaknesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/8ef28fb3eb5381b2f5d443caf06f2426.poster.avif?t=1767734306\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/8ef28fb3eb5381b2f5d443caf06f2426.webm?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/8ef28fb3eb5381b2f5d443caf06f2426.mp4?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc80<strong>Face Challenging Bosses</strong>\ud83d\udc80</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb your way up the leaderboard of champions, defeating each of the top ranked arena fighters on your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/4a3ad5538c9a956d5271d3e147a88211.poster.avif?t=1767734306\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/4a3ad5538c9a956d5271d3e147a88211.webm?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/4a3ad5538c9a956d5271d3e147a88211.mp4?t=1767734306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfb2<strong>Random Arenas And Events</strong>\ud83c\udfb2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entertain the crowd in different arenas with random events, making each fight come with it's own unique challenges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udd1d<strong>Interact With The Town</strong>\ud83e\udd1d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the people of the town and help them out to get bonuses that will help you on your way to the top!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls-lite fighting - Dodge, block, parry, and strike using responsive action combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op multiplayer - Become champions together with up to 16 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Class System - Buy starting classes with in game currency you get from defeating bosses, or unlock your class as you go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment - Customize your build with over 50 pieces of equipment from 5 different rarities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty adjustments - from easy to gladiator mode, choose what fits your skill level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your luck - Gamble for the most powerful enchantments and face beneficial or harmful events each fight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overpowered emotes - Use emotes strategically to gain favor with the crowd</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face new challenges - Each run will have new challenges randomly chosen based on the difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave - Stop whenever and pick back up where you left off</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Big W Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description